    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 21A (Right to Education) was added through the 86th Constitutional Amendment Act, 2002.",
        "Article 76 governs the appointment and duties of the Attorney General for India.",
        "Article 280 details the constitution and mandate of the Finance Commission.",
        "Emergency Provisions are categorized under Article 352 (National), Article 356 (State/President's Rule), and Article 360 (Financial)."
      ],
      "id": "q91w4x9"
